    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf71 Bento Blocks</strong> is a puzzle game that combines culinary creativity with brain-teasing challenges. Slice, arrange, and perfect your bento-making skills as you craft delicious lunch boxes at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/42fb493f6958dcd95506fcec56826e0c.poster.avif?t=1753920653\" width=620 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/42fb493f6958dcd95506fcec56826e0c.webm?t=1753920653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/42fb493f6958dcd95506fcec56826e0c.mp4?t=1753920653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2a Discover a fresh take on puzzle games as you <strong>slice</strong> and <strong>arrange</strong> ingredients to craft bento boxes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd4 Solve each puzzle with the fewest cuts to complete your <strong>recipe book</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf63 Discover new challenges and mechanics as you progress through various recipes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd62 Explore over <strong>100+</strong> <strong>hand-crafted levels</strong>, each with its own unique twist and satisfying solution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd8\ud83c\udffd\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Unwind with a game that blends culinary arts with <strong>cozy</strong> and <strong>relaxing </strong>puzzles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 Relaxing music and calming visuals.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf71 Bento Blocks</strong> is a puzzle game that combines culinary creativity with brain-teasing challenges. Slice, arrange, and perfect your bento-making skills as you craft delicious lunch boxes at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/42fb493f6958dcd95506fcec56826e0c.poster.avif?t=1753920653\" width=620 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/42fb493f6958dcd95506fcec56826e0c.webm?t=1753920653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311670/extras/42fb493f6958dcd95506fcec56826e0c.mp4?t=1753920653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2a Discover a fresh take on puzzle games as you <strong>slice</strong> and <strong>arrange</strong> ingredients to craft bento boxes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd4 Solve each puzzle with the fewest cuts to complete your <strong>recipe book</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf63 Discover new challenges and mechanics as you progress through various recipes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd62 Explore over <strong>100+</strong> <strong>hand-crafted levels</strong>, each with its own unique twist and satisfying solution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd8\ud83c\udffd\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Unwind with a game that blends culinary arts with <strong>cozy</strong> and <strong>relaxing </strong>puzzles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 Relaxing music and calming visuals.</p></li></ul>",
